{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07881","headline":"秦中苦雨思归赠袁左丞贺侍郎 · 孟浩然","name":"秦中苦雨思归赠袁左丞贺侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦学三十载，闭门江汉阴。\n用贤遭圣日，羇旅属秋霖。\n岂直昏垫苦，亦爲权势沈。\n二毛催白发，百镒罄黄金。\n泪忆岘山堕，愁怀湘水深。\n谢公积愤懑，庄舃空谣吟。\n跃马非吾事，狎鸥宜我心。\n寄言当路者，去矣北山岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}